		},
		{"id":"d1ff314db8d74096","type":"text","text":"# Resource Creation","x":-1540,"y":-300,"width":420,"height":600},
		{
			"id":"c364f75c3c486ee5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Structure\n\n## Interface Navigation\n\n\n## Home Page\n- Apex Dashboard: classes, assignments, calendar, Pomodoro timer, etc.\n\n\n## Divisions between files/sections\n- Longform: manually set order of notes within a \"project\"",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1080,
			"y":-300,
			"width":420,
			"height":600
		},
		{
			"id":"e33000e79d3694f5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Contextualization",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-160,
			"y":-300,
			"width":360,
			"height":600
		},
		{
			"id":"b33a56be0b417998",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Revisit\n- ZettelFlow\n- ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1420,
			"y":540,
			"width":440,
			"height":320
		},
		{
			"id":"1961a931a9d25a2d",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Writing & Maintenance\n- Track Changes: accept/reject suggestions\n- ",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-580,
			"y":-300,
			"width":380,
			"height":600
		},
		{
			"id":"2315e12a547fd062",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Core Values\n1. **Accessible**\n\t- language\n\t- ease of use\n\t- familiarity\n\t- tech support\n\t- flexibility\n\t- mouse & keyboard support\n\t- hardware sensitive (light)\n2. **Comprehensive**\n\t- wide swath of features integrated into 1 tool\n\t- incorporate as many parts of the educational process as possible\n\t- accommodate all use cases\n3. **Helpful**\n\t- efficiency\n\t- improvement\n\t- innovation\n\t- transparency\n4. **Scaleable**\n\t- single structure\n\t- fixed costs only (no per user, per use)\n\t- low tech maintenance skills\n\t- distributed oversight",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-580,
			"y":-1640,
			"width":520,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"80758ccde7f6226a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Design Principles\n1. Functionality Over Familiarity\n2. Proprietary In, Open Out\n3. 1 Source, Many Derivatives\n4. High Structure, Low Constraints\n5. 1 Process, Many Resources\n6. Layered Optionality for Zombies & Rebels",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1240,
			"y":-1620,
			"width":520,
			"height":380
		},
		{
			"id":"501ce4da5d1126e8",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# UX\n\n## Interface Navigation\n\n\n## Homepage\n- easiest access to active courses\n- access to previous courses\n- direct access to assignments\n- calendar with due dates & class meetings\n\n## Division between notes/sections\n",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-1610,
			"y":-1100,
			"width":420,
			"height":600
		},
		{"id":"88dcd3bbb1615ee3","type":"text","text":"# Teaching","x":-760,"y":-1100,"width":400,"height":600},
